## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pocket Essentials
## Author: ChrisMiho
## X-License: GPL-3.0
## X-Website: https://github.com/ChrisMiho/wow-forever-pocket-essentials
## Notes: Handheld-friendly helpers for WoW Forever: quest icons and a quest arrow, a bigger bag with sorting, auto sell junk and repair, a chat picker, a controller layout and small game fixes. Every feature starts off; a setup guide explains them.
